      ],
      "source": "https://www.barnes-madrid.com/en/news/lifestyle-5/what-to-see-and-do-in-castellana-64"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The street begins at Plaza de Colón and ends at the M‑30 ring road junction, the Nudo Norte.",
